# Kamal secrets — resolved at deploy time, never committed with real values.
#
# Local / workstation deploys: uncomment the 1Password block below (requires the
# `op` CLI, `kamal secrets` extension and access to the vault item).
#
# GitHub Actions: the workflow injects these as plain environment variables from
# repository/Environment secrets, so the fallback `ENV["..."]` lines are used.
#
# NOTE: YOURNALING_DB_PASSWORD and POSTGRES_PASSWORD MUST hold the same value
# (the app connects to the DB accessory with it).

# --- 1Password (local) --------------------------------------------------------
